Metals and metallurgical production sources — books, courses, methods, and cases (@metal-sources: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @metals-and-metallurgical-production) { r_03Z21BSG78ZRQSAVCCD6FJVNRY
Use the source attached to each Record for its complete reading and actual method. The spine combines whole books, substantial English/Portuguese technical works, full public university course progressions, graduate exercises, primary papers, complete production cases, original examples, and independent research.

An open licence, a freely readable copyrighted work, a public catalogue/abstract, and a commercial library/purchased book have distinct access and reuse conditions. Each source preserves its actual edition and scope; a portal or hosting-directory date does not automatically date a book or all its components.

**Extraction, chemistry, and balances:** [Principles of Extractive Metallurgy — Tarun Kumar Kundu, NPTEL](sources/Principles-of-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_7VCNEHN5VCQDDQTZ512PSHFZ78), [Non-ferrous Extractive Metallurgy — Ray and Pugazhenthy, NPTEL](sources/Nonferrous-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_29G1ZF58Y8EG123MNX3ZRNRE2W), [Materials, energy, and heat balances in metallurgical processes — Satish Ch. Koria](sources/Metallurgical-Material-and-Heat-Balances-NPTEL.lingua#r_38NWQRDJH3RVM3NNGB71RR1X43), [Hidrometalurgia — Virgínia Sampaio T. Ciminelli](sources/Hidrometalurgia-Ciminelli.lingua#r_6G9611F0V3GQXWW0C108RDQB9B), [Extração de Ouro: Princípios, Tecnologia e Meio Ambiente — CETEM](sources/Extracao-de-Ouro-CETEM.lingua#r_5TP6BXRQ7NWKZQZ94WCBQRR8PN), [Biohydrometallurgical Processes: A Practical Approach — CETEM](sources/Biohydrometallurgical-Processes-CETEM.lingua#r_6DQNK4H5798FVNTHJ48QF7QNGN).

